ndbook,\nworkspace guide and detailed FAQ for every supported role, bounded 100-250% keyboard zoom, frontend coverage checks,\nand named human review of fresh, newly created data and supported CRUD operations are complete. Follow the workspace review\nchecklist (guide 17). Missing evidence stays pending; seeded-demo browsing, API tests or screenshots alone do not\nestablish completion. Agents propose evidence; only authenticated human review accepts progress.","compulsory":[{"id":"q:f1_help","label":"F1 contextual help","what":"F1 opens the correct permitted help, including from fields/dialogs, preserves unsaved work and restores focus. Visible Help also works; login/locked/kiosk help exposes only public/operator guidance.","points":2},{"id":"q:role_faq","label":"Complete role-specific FAQs","what":"Every supported role task in this workspace, including shared screens and handovers, has a detailed reviewed English/Urdu FAQ. Follow get_handbook_outline; a generic FAQ or an unreviewed role journey is unfinished.","points":3},{"id":"q:zoom","label":"Keyboard zoom: 100-250% only","what":"Ctrl++/Ctrl+=, Ctrl+- and Ctrl+0 (Command on macOS), Settings and all enabled zoom routes share one state clamped to 100-250%. Test both bounds, reset, persistence and usable English/Urdu layouts at 250%.","points":2},{"id":"q:fresh_data","label":"Human review with newly created data","what":"A named human follows guide 17 on this build: creates new synthetic records through the UI and verifies read, update/correction and permitted delete/cancel/deactivate paths, refusal paths and handovers. Read-only screens use fresh upstream records. Record IDs and evidence; pre-existing demo data alone is insufficient.","points":4}],"zoom":{"min_pct":100,"max_pct":250,"reset_pct":100,"keys":["Ctrl + or Ctrl = (zoom in)","Ctrl - (zoom out)","Ctrl 0 (reset to 100 %)","Command on macOS"],"one_state":"The keys, the Settings slider and any menu, wheel or pinch zoom move ONE zoom state, clamped to 100.0-250.0 %, saved as ui_scale_pct (PUT /settings/me) and restored at login (/auth/me preferences). Electron: webContents.setZoomFactor(pct / 100)."},"workspace_done_when":"Every screen of the workspace has every compulsory item above, in addition to its endpoints, events and rules: F1 contextual Help, a detailed FAQ for every role of the workspace (English and Urdu), the bounded keyboard zoom and a named human's review with newly created data (get_guide('workspace-review-checklist')), signed on the portal. Missing any one, the workspace is NOT done: report it as pending, never as complete.","read":"get_ui_quality_brief(screen_id=...) or get_ui_quality_brief(workspace=...)"},"handbook_page":"screens/incident_register_owner","workspace_guide":"get_handbook_outline('owner_dashboard')","realtime":[{"event":"incident.reported","check":"the screen refreshes without polling"},{"event":"incident.updated","check":"the screen refreshes without polling"}],"acceptance_rules":["Inbox first: status Reported (review_overdue in red; a sentinel event arrives as incident.reported with priority critical: open it at once). Then UnderReview with analysis_overdue, then Analysed with actions still open.","Review form: confirm or correct type, kind and harm; the class shows what the list says (is_sentinel); switching it needs sentinel_reason. Pick the investigator (GET /quality/record-review/people lists active staff) and the due date (prefilled by the server when left empty). Or Withdraw with the reason (a duplicate, not an incident).","Detail: the report (a confidential reporter shows as 'Confidential' except to the managers), the review, the analysis, the actions; the buttons follow can_review / can_withdraw / can_analyse / can_add_action / can_close and next_step says what happens next.","Close asks for the follow-up; INCIDENT_ACTIONS_OPEN: actions are still open; a sentinel event needs an action done (INCIDENT_ACTION_REQUIRED). Print the report with its analysis (GET /incidents/{id}/pdf)."],"demo_accounts":"demo_accounts() lists a login per role; sandbox_call runs each case on the DEV server"}
